#====================================================================
# DRAFT-c-turtle-1.0.5-headeronly-root-relative-bundled-single-header.kv
# c-turtle 1.0.5 header-only 库公开头在仓库根相对 include 内置单头依赖
# （CImg.h）——Conan 打包必须把根级内置依赖头与主库头一并装入 include/
# 同目录，否则消费者编译失败；附带无 tag 上游以 commit 归档 URL 固定。
# Draft only. Do not promote into knowledge/graph until promoted.
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-c-turtle-1.0.5-headeronly-root-relative-bundled-single-header
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|clang
phase:                  packaging|compilation
error_signature:        fatal error: 'CImg.h' file not found|
                         No such file or directory.*include/|header-only.*package.*missing
severity:               2
category:               headers, conan, packaging, compat
match_keywords:         header-only, root-level, relative include, bundled, CImg,
                         single-header, package(), copy, ship, consumer build,
                         find_package, strip_root, no-tag, commit archive URL, sha256
title:                  Header-only 库公开头在仓库根相对 include 内置单头依赖时，Conan 打包必须把该单头与主库头一并装入 include/ 同目录，否则消费者编译失败
root_cause:             Header-only 库（如 c-turtle 1.0.5）公开头（CTurtle.hpp）
                         在仓库根直接 `#include "CImg.h"`；上游把 CImg 3.1MB 单头
                         vendored 在仓库根（非 external/<dep> 子目录）。配方若只
                         package() 复制主库头或按子目录模式复制，相对 include 在
                         消费者编译时无法命中 —— 依赖头未随包分发。
rec_approach:           Header-only-根级随包分发内置单头
rec_description:        conanfile.py package() 把主库头与根级内置单头依赖
                         （*.hpp 与 *.h）一并复制到 include/ 同一目录，保持
                         相对 include 布局；package_info() 仅设 includedirs=["include"]。
                         若依赖在制品仓已有独立配方且版本匹配，可选 requires 替代。
rec_command: |
  # c-turtle 1.0.5 实例
  copy(self, "CTurtle.hpp", src=self.source_folder,
       dst=join(self.package_folder, "include"))
  copy(self, "CImg.h", src=self.source_folder,
       dst=join(self.package_folder, "include"))
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/c/c-turtle/1.0.5 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
affected_scope:         所有公开头在仓库根相对 include 内置单头依赖的 header-only C/C++ 库在 Conan 2 + OHOS 配包装插；CImg 系、stb 系同族库
rec_priority:           1
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe-pattern
keywords:               header-only, root-level, relative include, bundled, CImg, single-header, include, package, consumer, conan, no-tag, commit-archive-url